WEBVTT

00:53:28.996 --> 00:53:33.413
And I think it is technically possible for
this to be sort of like a layer above

00:53:33.413 --> 00:53:36.788
the neocortex that makes even better
decisions for us and our welfare

00:53:36.788 --> 00:53:39.371
and our long term happiness and
fulfillment than we could make

00:53:39.371 --> 00:53:43.329
on our own. And I think it is possible
for us as a society to demand that.

00:53:43.788 --> 00:53:48.038
And if we can do like a pincer move
between what the technology is capable of

00:53:48.038 --> 00:53:49.996
and what we what we as society demand,

00:53:50.163 --> 00:53:52.329
maybe we can make everybody
in the middle that way.

00:53:54.496 --> 00:53:58.663
I mean, there are instances of even though
companies have their incentives to

00:53:58.663 --> 00:54:03.329
make money and so forth, they
also in the knowledge age.